features HAVE_CRYPTO
description re-encrypt short PKWARE entry to AES-256 without stale data descriptor
program zipsh_regress_nonrandom
return 0
arguments encrypt.zzip
stdin
set_default_password no-entropy
file_encryption -i 1 AES-256 no-entropy
end-of-inline-data
file encrypt.zzip encrypt-pkware-noentropy.zip encrypt-aes256-noentropy.zip
